{"steam_appid":2998920,"steam_name":"Port of Jumanah","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2998920/1879537728/782b77e5ab540b2acd1a7491b6be0641557f956b/1788795184/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788795729","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257023947/c9c9cce496772db61c572f9b91bc5435143ff237/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788795729","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/e50e078e222dbb3d9e63ffc2096dde12e541eb71/ss_e50e078e222dbb3d9e63ffc2096dde12e541eb71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788795781","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/9e69a346521940a7ed6dade5ec15acfa2f65163d/ss_9e69a346521940a7ed6dade5ec15acfa2f65163d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788795781","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/400b15a9f1cf662dc0917ea36e88709719c5fddf/ss_400b15a9f1cf662dc0917ea36e88709719c5fddf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788795781","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/26c271741df86cbba509f474f1a078691567a2ed/ss_26c271741df86cbba509f474f1a078691567a2ed.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788795781","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/461b625fa43277d2ad63ef40afb59ec077aedc91/ss_461b625fa43277d2ad63ef40afb59ec077aedc91.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788795781"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >F is for &quot;Friends who do stuff together&quot;!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it wise to go on long voyages by yourself? Maybe. But a crew behind your back makes you look a little cooler. Recruit your friends to your vessel, and they will help you on your journeys. There is also a cat! What do they bring to the table? The only way to find out is to recruit them, but no way you're getting a CV out of any of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/0267326b913b4a0ead8099d8413589db.poster.avif?t=1788795781\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/0267326b913b4a0ead8099d8413589db.webm?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/0267326b913b4a0ead8099d8413589db.mp4?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sail Away, Sail Away</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a multitude of oceans, each with a different environment and unique species. Find treasures,  defeat whatever is lurking beneath the surface, and be on your merry way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/4e53737e23c700c58b33717e458d4797.poster.avif?t=1788795781\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/4e53737e23c700c58b33717e458d4797.webm?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/4e53737e23c700c58b33717e458d4797.mp4?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s in the waters?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The depths of the oceans hide many questions, and among them - the most important one - why is everything in there so salty?! Prepare to meet unexpected friends and foes, have deep &amp; meaningful conversations, or simply kick them right in their fins. Will you let the seas push you around, or will your not-so-elegant breast strokes push you through the currents and challenges?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/20c77d0a33906e56be437a45975cecb5.poster.avif?t=1788795781\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/20c77d0a33906e56be437a45975cecb5.webm?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/20c77d0a33906e56be437a45975cecb5.mp4?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise from zero to…? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to upgrade your kit to complete even more missions. That’s called a gameplay loop, baby! Unlock new abilities and gear to help you out during your descents into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/ef1f19bb201f1cb87732f2837300a8db.poster.avif?t=1788795781\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/ef1f19bb201f1cb87732f2837300a8db.webm?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/ef1f19bb201f1cb87732f2837300a8db.mp4?t=1788795781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 4GB , RX 560 4GB or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F, AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GTX 1660 6GB / RTX 3050 6GB / RX 6600 8GB or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["Red Dunes Games","Agate"],"publishers":["Red Dunes Games"],"release_date":"Sep 7, 2026"}